IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PAGED-SPLITFUSE-V3.

DATA DIVISION.
01 PREFILL-TOKENS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 DECODE-TOKENS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 PAGE-SIZE           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PSF-V3.
    IF PREFILL-TOKENS == 0 OR DECODE-TOKENS == 0 OR PAGE-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 26400 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PREFILL-TOKENS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
